      "type": "explain",
      "id": "e2",
      "title": "The alphabet and spelling your name",
      "body": "Tip for the hard ones. G is zhay (not “gee”). J is zhee (not “jay”). E is uh, I is ee. W is “double V” in French. Y is “i grec” (Greek i)."
    },
